-| `tax_declaration_vs_julien.pdf` | 3 fields (1 wrong : false impot_federal) | 2 fields (both correct) |
-| `avs_ik_extract.pdf` | 0/4 fields, conf 0.00 | 2/4 fields, conf 0.73 |
