-- **Fix:** Replaced the test with `test_gc_border_case_just_under_30_days`, hand-building a fixture at 29d23h mtime. Tests the inclusive-<= contract intent (a file comfortably inside retention stays) without chasing wall-clock jitter. Documented rationale in test docstring.
