-### Pattern 2: Bracketing TOP+BOTTOM (CTX-03)
-
-**What:** Liu 2024 "Lost in the Middle" (TACL, arXiv:2307.03172) `[CITED: Panel C + arXiv]` mesure recall en U — ~75% début, ~50% milieu, ~70% fin. Écart 20-25pts début/milieu. Anthropic prompting guide officiel recommande "place important instructions AFTER long documents" `[CITED: Panel C]`.
-
-**When:** Pour les 5 règles critiques (D-06) qui DOIVENT être appliquées à chaque output.
-
-**Example (target CLAUDE.md structure):**
-```markdown
-# CLAUDE.md — MINT Project Context
-
-## TOP — 5 RULES CRITIQUES (repeat at BOTTOM — lost-in-the-middle mitigation)
-1. Banned terms → never "garanti", "optimal", "meilleur", "conseiller"
-2. Accents 100% FR → creer→créer, eclairage→éclairage, decouvrir→découvrir
-3. MINT ≠ retirement app → 18 life events, frame generically
-4. Financial_core reuse mandatory → lib/services/financial_core/*, never hand-roll
-5. i18n required → AppLocalizations.of(context)!.key, never Text('Bonjour')
-
-## 1. IDENTITY
-[… content ~100L quickref …]
-
-## 2-N. [Architecture, commands, pointers to docs/AGENTS/*.md]
-[… routing by role: Flutter agents → docs/AGENTS/flutter.md etc …]
-
-## BOTTOM — 5 RULES CRITIQUES (duplicated intentionally, Liu 2024)
-1. Banned terms → [same]
-2. Accents 100% FR → [same]
-3. MINT ≠ retirement app → [same]
-4. Financial_core reuse mandatory → [same]
-5. i18n required → [same]
-```
-
-### Pattern 3: Triplets `{bad → good → why}` (CTX-03)
-
-**What:** Min et al. EMNLP 2022 (arXiv:2202.12837) `[CITED: Panel C]` démontre que démonstrations (few-shot) recall 85-95% vs instruction négative 50-70%. Effet "don't think of an elephant" (Perez 2022 Red Teaming) : `NEVER` active la représentation du concept interdit.
-
-**Example format (mandatory for 10 NEVERs listed D-07):**
-```markdown
-### NEVER #1 — Hardcode user-facing strings
-- **Bad:**
-  ```dart
-  Text('Bonjour')
-  ```
-- **Good:**
-  ```dart
-  Text(AppLocalizations.of(context)!.greetingMorning)
-  ```
-- **Why:** i18n drift 6 langues (fr/en/de/es/it/pt), ARB parity breaks, l10n CI fails, bloque MintShell audit FIX-06 Phase 36.
-```
