-- Exact file layout under `tools/mcp/mint-tools/` (prefer: `server.py`, `tools/{constants,banned_terms,arb_parity,accents}.py`, `tests/`)
-- Internal JSON schema per tool payload (follow `mcp` SDK conventions)
-- Exact version string format — default `{major}.{minor}.{patch}` matching phase number
-- Dedicated venv path layout (suggest: `tools/mcp/mint-tools/.venv/` gitignored)
