-**1. [Rule 1 - Bug] 3-tier trace_id fallback needed (not 2-tier as specified in plan `<action>` Step 2)**
-- **Found during:** Task 1 RED phase (3 tests failing with KeyError 'trace_id' AND captured stderr showing `trace_id: "-"`).
