-- Math: 43 × 10 hits/day × 30 = 12'900 events/mo = **0.258% Sentry Business 50k/mo**. At 5k DAU real scale = ~1-2% quota (still safely under $160 ceiling). Revisit at 10k DAU for Enterprise.
