-- **Flutter UI `/admin/routes`** (MAP-02b): **REGISTRY SCHEMA VIEWER ONLY**.
-  - Columns: `path | category | owner | requiresAuth | killFlag | FeatureFlags enabled (local) | description`
-  - Grouped by owner (15 buckets collapsible).
