-wc -l /tmp/extracted_routes.txt  # Expect 147 (or document drift in KNOWN-MISSES)
-grep -cE "ScopedGoRoute\(|GoRoute\(" apps/mobile/lib/app.dart  # Expect 150 (147 + 3 bare GoRoute)
-```
