-
-**What:** `OnboardingOrchestrator` exposes a `Stream<OnboardingState>` where `state.canShowHero` flips true once all 6 axes (AVS / LPP / 3a / salaire / fortune / charges) reach `ConfidenceComponent.complete >= 0.5`.
