-**Trade-offs:**
-- **Pro:** Reuses `ConfidenceScorer` (11 components, Bayesian, 86 usages already).
-- **Pro:** Avoids fake hero numbers — NEVER #8 (no promises) compliance.
-- **Con:** May feel slow to user. Mitigation: progressive reveal (2-3 axes → "we have a partial picture", all 6 → hero unlocks).
+Then in `applyFromMap`, call `applyRouteFlagsFromMap(data)` at the end. **Zero breaking change** to the 9 existing flags.
