-## Technical Debt Patterns
-
-| Shortcut | Immediate Benefit | Long-term Cost | When Acceptable |
-|----------|-------------------|----------------|-----------------|
-| Hardcode `7258 / 36288` constants in scene widget | Quick render | Drifts from MCP `get_swiss_constants` on next year update; compliance bug | NEVER — use injected service or generated constants |
-| Use `Future<CoachResponse>` shim returning `Stream<CoachResponse>.fromFuture(…)` instead of native Stream | Fast Phase 42 ship | Buffers entire response — kills the live-feel UX that justifies the entire visual layer | Only as a temporary feature-flagged adapter for rollback safety |
-| Skip Dart parity test, "backend is source of truth, slider just calls /preview" | Avoids duplicate logic | Backend roundtrip per slider tick = backend DDoS, jank (Pitfall 2) | NEVER — local recompute is non-negotiable for slider UX |
-| Render hero with point estimate first, add band "later" | Phase 41 ships faster | LSFin violation if released, NEVER #8/#9 violation, post-mortem material | NEVER — band + confidence is the FIRST commit of hero work |
-| Machine-translate ARB to non-FR languages, ship, "fix later" | 5× faster L10N | Banned-term violations, plural breaks, accent issues, real users see broken UI | NEVER for hero / CTA / disclaimer; acceptable only for non-user-facing tooltips temporarily |
-| Reuse existing Explorer screens via `WebView` to embed prototype HTML | Skip the Flutter port | Native UX broken, accessibility broken, theme broken, masking broken | NEVER (handoff §02 explicitly forbids) |
-| `Navigator.push(MaterialPageRoute)` for canvas | Quickest implementation | Breaks deep-link, breaks Phase 32 registry parity, breaks back-button on Android | NEVER — register canvas as a GoRoute |
-| Disable `chatVivant` flag in tests, keep enabled in dev | Tests stay green | Flag-on path goes untested; production users hit code that wasn't golden-tested | Acceptable only if explicit `chatVivant_on` test suite exists in parallel |
-| Single completeness threshold (60%) gates hero | Simple gate | LPP-axis false-positive (Pitfall 4) | NEVER — must use criticality-weighted per-axis thresholds |
-| Wrap `try-catch` to "make tests green" without surfacing error | CI green | FIX-05 Wave 2+ regression — silenced P0 bugs | NEVER — every catch must Sentry.captureException + rethrow OR show user-visible error |
