-## Integration Gotchas
-
-| Integration | Common Mistake | Correct Approach |
-|-------------|----------------|------------------|
-| Existing `CoachOrchestrator` (3 paths) | Big-bang Stream rewrite | Adapter pattern; old Future stays callable behind flag, new Stream wraps it (Pitfall 1) |
-| `financial_core/` Dart calculators | Copy-paste calculation into a scene widget | Inject calculator via Provider; widget calls `LppCalculator.computeRachatHeadroom(profile)` (NEVER #3) |
-| Backend `compute_marge_fiscale` | Two implementations diverge | Shared JSON fixture + property-based parity test; constants generated from `swiss_constants.json` (Pitfall 8) |
-| `ComplianceGuard` (LLM output scrubbing) | Forget Flutter-side hardcoded copy | Run `check_banned_terms` MCP on every ARB value (Pitfall 7) |
-| Sentry Replay (`maskAllText:true`) | Trust global mask covers CustomPaint | Wrap every CustomPaint in `MintCustomPaintMask` (Pitfall 6) |
-| GoRouter (148 routes) | `Navigator.push` for canvas modal | Register `/coach/canvas/:sceneId` as a `Page` route (Pitfall 3) |
-| `IntentResolver` | Add scene mapping but no test asserting end-to-end resolution | Test from `respondTo(userMessage)` to `messages.last.kind == mintScene` (Pitfall 10) |
-| `EnhancedConfidence` (4-axis geometric mean) | Use arithmetic mean for simplicity | Geometric mean is mandatory; LPP-axis criticality weight overrides for marge fiscale gate (Pitfall 4) |
