-## Performance Traps
-
-| Trap | Symptoms | Prevention | When It Breaks |
-|------|----------|------------|----------------|
-| Slider `onChanged` runs full `compute_marge_fiscale` on UI isolate | Drag jank, p95 > 32ms, dropped frames | Two-tier (preview / settle) + `compute()` isolate (Pitfall 2) | Immediately on iPhone 8 (floor device); even iPhone 14 if calc is non-trivial |
-| Backend hit on every slider tick | Railway rate-limit, error toasts mid-drag | Local Dart recompute, server only on settle | At ~3 concurrent users dragging |
-| Stream subscription leaks across screen transitions | Memory grows, eventual OOM, `setState after dispose` errors | `AutoCancelMixin`, lifecycle audit (Pitfall 1) | After ~50 screen transitions in a session |
-| Rebuild entire chat list on every new message | Frame drop on every chat tick | `ListView.builder` with stable keys, `const` widgets, `kind`-based switch with builder factories | At ~30 messages in a single conversation |
-| Re-resolve intent on every chat input keystroke | LLM tokens spike, latency | Debounce 300ms on input, only resolve on send | Immediately if user types ≥5 wpm |
-| `gen-l10n` regenerated on every save (file watcher) | Hot-reload latency 2-3s | Run on git pre-commit only, not on file save | After ARB grows >150 keys |
-| Sentry Replay capture full session in dev | Battery drain, slow staging tests | `sessionSampleRate: 0.0` in dev/test (already done per main.dart D-01 Option C) | Always; only `onErrorSampleRate: 1.0` is on |
-| All scenes loaded eagerly in `SceneRegistry` | App startup time grows | Lazy-load scene widgets via factories (already in handoff §02) | After ~10 scenes registered |
-| Profile `PATCH /profiles/me` fires on every keystroke in wizard | Backend spam | Fire-and-forget with debounce 500ms per field (Pitfall 4) | At Q3+ in wizard with chatty users |
