-## Security Mistakes
-
-| Mistake | Risk | Prevention |
-|---------|------|------------|
-| CHF amount visible in Sentry Replay (CustomPaint not masked) | nLPD violation, GDPR-equiv breach | `MintCustomPaintMask` mandatory wrap (Pitfall 6) |
-| Slider value tooltip leaks via Flutter native render | nLPD violation | Custom value indicator OR `SentryMask` wrap on Slider (Pitfall 6) |
-| `Profile` JSON in error logs | PII leak (salaire, IBAN, AVS) | Sentry `beforeSend` scrubber covers `lib/services/financial_core/` already; verify scope includes new scene/canvas widgets |
-| Hero `MargeFiscaleResult` cached in SharedPreferences without encryption | At-rest PII leak on rooted device | Use SecureStorage like JWT/BYOK already do — financial_core results are PII |
-| `save_fact` writes to backend without round-trip verification on Flutter | Audit P0-4 — data lost across surfaces | Wire FIX-03 BEFORE Phase 42 |
-| Coach output via Stream skipped through ComplianceGuard mid-stream | Banned term leaks to user before scrub | ComplianceGuard runs at the END of token aggregation, not mid-stream; Stream API guarantees one ChatMessage = one fully-scrubbed unit |
-| FATCA archetype inferring 3a deduction value | Misleading expat_us users | Archetype switch on every `compute_marge_fiscale` call (Pitfall 5) |
-| BYOK Anthropic key visible in Sentry breadcrumbs of new Stream path | Account takeover risk | Breadcrumb scrubber must cover Stream path; existing config covers Future path — verify extension |
-| Canvas `ReturnContract.finalState` includes user-PII (salaire) in chat history (SharedPreferences) | At-rest PII | SecureStorage for chat history that contains canvas returns; OR redact PII in finalState before persisting |
-| Anonymous flow visible to scenes | User could "see" hero before auth (data wasn't theirs) | Hero rendering gated on `auth.signedIn == true` (Anonymous chat does NOT show hero) |
