-## UX Pitfalls
-
-| Pitfall | User Impact | Better Approach |
-|---------|-------------|-----------------|
-| Hero shows "0 CHF de marge" because data incomplete | User concludes app says they have nothing to optimize | Show "données insuffisantes — ajoute X pour estimer ta marge" with explicit CTA |
-| Onboarding wizard >6 questions before any insight | 40%+ drop-off | First insight in ≤3 inputs (âge, canton, salaire), refine progressively (Pitfall 4) |
-| Slider visual leads compute by 200ms+ | Confusing — number lags physical drag | `onChanged` updates visual + preview immediately; settle on release (Pitfall 2) |
-| Canvas close → silent return to chat | User doesn't know what just happened | Always emit a recap message, even on dismiss (handoff §02 invariant) |
-| Banded hero ("entre 800 et 2'400 CHF") looks vague | User trust erodes ("est-ce que c'est sérieux?") | Pair band with confidence ring + "comment affiner?" CTA — uncertainty made constructive |
-| Disclaimer wall above scene | Cognitive load, scrolls past insight | Disclaimer foot-of-screen, dismiss-able, persistent footer (handoff invariant — and audit P1-1 already flagged stacked disclaimers) |
-| Scene CTA "Creuser" leads to canvas with same info as scene | User feels duped — canvas is a hat trick | Canvas adds NEW info: chapters, sensitivity sliders, deeper hypotheses, link to Explorer screen |
-| Slider tick value shown in tooltip (PII leak too — Pitfall 6) | Erodes nLPD compliance + clutters UI | Render value below the slider in a stable spot, masked-by-default |
-| Hero copy frames as retirement | Excludes 18-30 segment, NEVER #4 violation | "Marge fiscale optimisable cette année" — life-event neutral; if archetype implies retirement, scene-specific framing only inside relevant scenes |
-| Coach asks "rente ou capital?" but user's financial_core says they have CHF 0 LPP | Coach is tone-deaf | Intent resolver consults profile; if no LPP, redirect to "tu n'as pas encore de LPP — voici tes priorités" |
-| Slider can be dragged to absurd values (age 130, rendement 25%) | Eroding seriousness | Hard caps with snap-back animation, soft caps with visible warning ("rendement >7% optimiste") |
-| Scene/canvas buttons are colored (NEVER #2 + handoff invariant 6) | Inconsistent with app, NEVER #2 | CTA noirs (textPrimary) per handoff invariant 6 — golden test asserts |
