-## Recovery Strategies
-
-| Pitfall | Recovery Cost | Recovery Steps |
-|---------|---------------|----------------|
-| Stream regression breaks 3 paths in production | HIGH | Toggle `chatVivant` flag OFF via remote config (`/config/feature-flags`) — instant rollback to Future path; investigate, fix, re-enable per cohort |
-| Marge fiscale Dart/Python drift detected post-merge | MEDIUM | Backend always wins (server-authoritative); regen `swiss_constants.dart` from JSON; ship hotfix; backfill parity test for the regression case |
-| Canvas leaks PII in Sentry Replay | HIGH | Disable Sentry Replay (`replaysOnErrorSampleRate: 0.0`) via remote config; deploy mask wrappers; rotate any exposed sessions in storage; nLPD incident report |
-| Banned term shipped in ARB (one language) | MEDIUM | Hotfix ARB entry; ship over-the-air via app update; if pre-1d post-release, recall via TestFlight/Play Console; ComplianceGuard does not catch ARB strings — add lint to prevent recurrence |
-| Hero unlocks too early (false-positive) | MEDIUM | Tighten gate threshold via remote config flag (criticality weights are configurable); push update; users with bad-data-hero re-shown a "tighten data" prompt |
-| Slider hits backend on drag (load incident) | LOW | Toggle slider feature flag OFF; ship local-only recompute; backfill is local-only by default — no data corruption |
-| Onboarding drop-off blows budget on Day 1 launch | MEDIUM | A/B test wizard ordering; reduce required-axes count via flag; iterate weekly |
-| `Navigator.push` deep-link breakage | LOW | Add GoRoute registration; redirect old deep links; ship update |
-| Façade — widget shipped unreachable | LOW (no user impact) | Phase 32 audit catches it; either wire entry point or delete widget; never deliver "implemented but inert" — audit P1-2/P1-3/P0-3 v2.5 lessons |
-| Save_fact regression entrenched under Stream layer | HIGH | Revert Phase 42 commit; fix save_fact at Future-layer; redo Stream refactor on top of fixed foundation |
-| Sentry Replay PII frame already shipped to Sentry servers | HIGH | nLPD incident; request Sentry data deletion via account; document; rotate concerned user data; legal notification per nLPD art. 24 if "high risk" |
