-### Architecture Approach
-
-The architecture is additive, not reconstructive. `CoachOrchestrator` gains `streamCoachResponse()` returning `Stream<ChatMessage>` ALONGSIDE (not replacing) the existing `generateChat()` `Future<CoachResponse>`. Visual elements are delivered via the existing `tool_calls` envelope with three new tool names: `show_vignette`, `show_scene`, `show_canvas`. A new `chat_projection/` service layer (SceneRegistry + ChatProjectionService) decouples visual rendering decisions from LLM orchestration. The Dart `MargeFiscaleCalculator` in `financial_core/` mirrors the Python backend function exactly, verified by shared JSON golden fixtures.
-
-**Major components and responsibilities:**
-
-1. **`compute_marge_fiscale` (Python + Dart mirror)** — pure function, 6 Swiss axes (AVS/LPP/3a/salaire/fortune/charges), archetype-aware, canton-aware, returns `MargeFiscaleBreakdown` with confidence bands and hypotheses. Golden fixtures in `marge_fiscale_golden.json` used by BOTH test suites.
-2. **`streamCoachResponse()` on `CoachOrchestrator`** — new additive method wrapping existing 3-path Future chain; emits `ChatMessage.typing`, `.mintText`, `.mintScene`, `.mintVignette` in correct order; feature-flagged behind `enableChatVivant`.
-3. **`chat_projection/` layer** — `SceneRegistry` (sceneId to widget factory), `ChatProjectionService` (inserts visual ChatMessages into stream), `ReturnContract`/`RecapBuilder` (Phase 43). Separated from `coach/` because different change cadence.
-4. **`MargeFiscaleHero`** — reads from `MargeFiscaleCalculator.compute()` directly (no backend roundtrip); renders Bas/Moyen/Haut band + confidence ring; gated by `OnboardingOrchestrator.canShowHero`.
-5. **`MintCanvasArbitrage`** — pushed via `PageRouteBuilder(opaque: false)` from scene CTA; 4 chapters + verdict + `MintSensibiliteWidget`; closes via `Navigator.pop<CanvasReturn>()` which triggers `RecapBuilder`. Silent canvas close is a bug — always emit recap.
-6. **`OnboardingOrchestrator`** — state machine over `ConfidenceScorer` (existing, 86 usages); LPP-axis criticality-weighted gate (not arithmetic mean); fires PATCH to `/profiles/me` on every answer.
