-### Phase Ordering Rationale
-
-- **40 before everything:** Golden fixtures defined here are consumed by Phases 41 (hero display), 42 (Dart slider recompute), and 43 (canvas sensitivity sliders). Inverting this order means UI phases build on unvalidated calculations.
-- **41 before 42:** Vignettes are read-only (no Stream). Validates ChatMessage schema extension and ComplianceText wrapper at low risk. Phase 42's Stream refactor needs a stable widget layer to insert messages into.
-- **42 sub-phase 42.1 before 42.2:** Stream refactor is the riskiest atomic unit of the entire milestone. If scenes are built before the stream contract is stable, they must be rewritten when the contract changes.
-- **43 last:** Canvas is the deepest UI layer. Placing it last means if Phase 42 slips, Phase 43 can be cleanly deferred to v2.9.1 without breaking Phases 40-42.
