-     - **b. Log + rethrow** — add `logger.error(...)` + `raise`.
-     - **c. Log + swallow (legitimate best-effort)** — add `logger.warning(...)` + document why in comment.
-  3. Write one PR per ~10 catches. Each PR includes the decision matrix for reviewer.
